{"id":"uzzi","name":"Uzzi","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:uzzi"],"types":[{"type":"person","from":"UBS: Names of People"}],"standing":"single-index","indexes":["nave"],"thin":false,"groups":["1. A priest"],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Uzzi","text":"The Lord is my strength. (1.) The son of Bukki, and a descendant of Aaron (1 Chr. 6:5, 51; Ezra 7:4). (2.) A grandson of Issachar (1 Chr. 7:2, 3). (3.) A son of Bela, and grandson of Benjamin (1 Chr. 7:7). (4.) A Benjamite, a chief in the tribe (1 Chr. 9:8). (5.) A son of Bani. He had the oversight of the Levites after the return from captivity (Neh. 11:22). (6.) The head of the house of Jedaiah, one of “the chief of the priests” (Neh. 12:19). (7.) A priest who assisted in the dedication of the walls of Jerusalem (Neh. 12:42)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H5813","lemma":"עֻזִּי","xlit":"ʻUzzîy","gloss":"Uzzi, the name of six Israelites","kjv":"Uzzi","count":11,"share":1},{"strong":"H7218","lemma":"רֹאשׁ","xlit":"rôʼsh","gloss":"the head , whether literal or figurative","kjv":"band, beginning, captain, chapiter","count":3,"share":0.27},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":7,"share":0.64},{"strong":"H1004","lemma":"בַּיִת","xlit":"bayith","gloss":"a house","kjv":"court, daughter, door, dungeon","count":3,"share":0.27}],"verses":["1Chr.6.5","1Chr.6.6","1Chr.6.51","1Chr.7.2","1Chr.7.3","1Chr.7.7","1Chr.9.8","Ezra.7.4","Neh.11.22","Neh.12.19","Neh.12.42"],"witnesses":["n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n","n"],"agreed":0,"broader":[],"narrower":[],"related":[{"id":"bukki","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.25,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"zerahiah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.25,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"aaron","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.02,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"head","type":"lexical","strong":"H7218","